    [CI] Add recent release tags to image build workflow (#18408)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Add the following release tags to the `docker_ref` options of the image
    build and push workflow:
    
    - `v0.30.0rc1`
    - `v0.29.0.rc1`
    - `v0.28.0.rc1`
    
    This allows maintainers to manually rebuild and publish container images
    for these releases through `workflow_dispatch`.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/8cc9aa5ad350f6f80cf3bebb298d410803ff75a9
    
    Signed-off-by: MrZ20 <2609716663@qq.com>

